support_text:
@777941 Got it. Let's start by closing any apps currently open, then performing a normal restart on the device. This can help with software issues.

How to force an app to close on your iPhone: https://t.co/uyzgez0J6G

Restart your iPhone: https://t.co/d59djUbfjV

@143271 Congrats on completing the activity! We have an article that addresses Activity Badges, https://t.co/xwf6lrIgzJ

Keep in mind, if you complete an achievement, but don't earn the award.
You will earn the award within 9 days of completing the Activity Challenge.
